  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "The BODMAS rule is given as follows-\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/1ec9ea6dd41f56c1cda246e7140f1fff03d05ed0511381002095222896a6035b.png] \n\n**Given equation**: 11 + 13 × 3 - 14 ÷ 7 = 44 \n\nNow, we check the given options as follows-\n\n**Option 1)** 14 and 11\n\n⇒ 14 + 13 × 3 - __**11 ÷ 7**__ = 44 \n\n⇒ 14 + __**13 × 3**__ - 1.571 = 44 \n\n⇒ __**14 + 39**__ - 1.571 = 44\n\n⇒ 53 - 1.571 = 44\n\n⇒ 51.429 ≠ 44\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 11 and 13\n\n⇒ 13 + 11 × 3 - __**14 ÷ 7 **__= 44 \n\n⇒ 13 + __**11**____** × 3**__ - 2 = 44 \n\n⇒ __**13 + 33**__ - 2 = 44\n\n⇒ __**46 - 2**__ = 44\n\n⇒ **44 = 44**\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) 14 and 13\n\n⇒ 11 + 14 × 3 - __**13 ÷ 7**__ = 44 \n\n⇒ 11 + __14 × 3__ - 1.857 = 44 \n\n⇒ __11 + 42 __- 1.857 = 44\n\n⇒ 53 - 1.857 = 44\n\n⇒ 51.143 ≠ 44\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 11 and 7\n\n⇒ 7 + 13 × 3 - __**14 ÷ 11**__ = 44\n\n⇒ 7 + __13 × 3__ - 1.27 = 44 \n\n⇒ __**7 + 39**__ - 1.27 = 44\n\n⇒ 46 - 1.27 = 44\n\n⇒ 44.72 ≠ 44\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**Option 2**\".",
